// Full feature changelog, in reverse-chronological order — the single source of
// truth for both the User Guide's Changelog tab and the Home dashboard's
// "What's New" widget (which just takes the first few entries). Update this file
// (not a second hand-maintained list) after each feature, alongside CHANGELOG.md.
//
// Each dated entry is an `h3` block optionally carrying a `tabId` — the sidebar
// nav id to jump to via onNavigate when the entry maps cleanly to one current
// tab. Bundled/multi-feature entries and structural changes (nav redesigns,
// phase-numbered bundles from the app's early build) are intentionally left
// without a tabId rather than guessing which of several tabs they mean.

